WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.946
Cat whispered to Tom.

2
00:00:20.947 --> 00:00:23.927
"Tell the unicorn you are a great wizard.

3
00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:29.224
Tell her that you can make monsters appear."

4
00:00:29.225 --> 00:00:32.205
Cat slipped into the trees.

5
00:00:32.206 --> 00:00:35.623
"I am a great wizard!" Tom cried.

6
00:00:35.624 --> 00:00:39.011
"I will get a monster to fight you, Unicorn!"

7
00:00:39.012 --> 00:00:42.011
The unicorn laughed.

8
00:00:42.012 --> 00:00:45.418
"You? A great wizard?"

9
00:00:45.419 --> 00:00:51.639
"Alakazam!" Tom pretended to say a spell. "Abracadabra!"

10
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:58.660
The unicorn laughed and laughed.

11
00:00:58.661 --> 00:01:03.791
Then a fierce growl came from the trees.

12
00:01:03.792 --> 00:01:08.290
The unicorn looked around.

13
00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:11.318
"What's that?" she asked nervously.

14
00:01:11.319 --> 00:01:14.616
Cat was hiding behind the trees.

15
00:01:14.617 --> 00:01:19.443
She moaned and howled.

16
00:01:19.444 --> 00:01:23.580
"That is my monster!" Tom said loudly.

17
00:01:23.581 --> 00:01:27.629
"Your monster?" the unicorn said.

18
00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:31.258
"See?" Princess Mary said to the unicorn.

19
00:01:31.259 --> 00:01:37.515
"Tom is a great wizard!"

20
00:01:37.516 --> 00:01:44.831
Cat ran to find the ogre.

21
00:01:44.832 --> 00:01:51.337
He was sleeping near a cave.

22
00:01:51.338 --> 00:01:56.710
Cat snarled in his ear.

23
00:01:56.711 --> 00:02:03.029
The ogre woke up.

24
00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:09.808
Cat ran back to the unicorn's woods.

25
00:02:09.809 --> 00:02:15.287
Cat growled and howled like a monster.

26
00:02:15.288 --> 00:02:17.696
The unicorn looked scared.

27
00:02:17.697 --> 00:02:22.595
"Princess Mary can return to the castle!" the unicorn said.

28
00:02:22.596 --> 00:02:27.931
"Just tell your monster to go away!"

29
00:02:27.932 --> 00:02:31.156
Tom and Princess Mary ran out of the clearing.

30
00:02:31.157 --> 00:02:35.080
Cat dashed after them.

31
00:02:35.081 --> 00:02:38.920
"Hey!" The unicorn spotted Cat.

32
00:02:38.921 --> 00:02:41.660
"That's not a monster!"

33
00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:44.095
The unicorn stamped her hoof.

34
00:02:44.096 --> 00:02:51.860
"Wizard, you tricked me!"
